WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.850
[Phone ringing]

00:00:00.850 --> 00:00:01.400
Your hands are full. The phone still rings.

00:00:01.400 --> 00:00:02.600
[Second phone ring; connection chime]

00:00:02.600 --> 00:00:05.000
The second ring. That’s where BotBound begins.

00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:06.500
BotBound answers.

00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:08.250
On-brand. On the second ring. Ready to help.

00:00:08.250 --> 00:00:09.400
“Thanks for calling. How can I help?”

00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:10.400
Configured example. Not a voicemail maze.

00:00:10.400 --> 00:00:11.600
Caller: “Can you fit in a cake pickup Friday?”

00:00:11.600 --> 00:00:12.800
BotBound: “Absolutely. I can hold 4:30. Does that work?”

00:00:12.800 --> 00:00:13.500
Caller: “Perfect.”

00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:14.900
BotBound: “You’re booked. I just texted the details.”

00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:16.800
Configured example. Listen. Decide. Act.

00:00:16.800 --> 00:00:19.000
Capture caller intent. Follow your rules. Move to the next step.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:20.800
Your Bot keeps the call moving. You stay in the work.

00:00:22.200 --> 00:00:23.600
Better with every review.

00:00:23.600 --> 00:00:25.600
Build. Train. Launch. Improve.

00:00:26.400 --> 00:00:28.200
BotBound. You can't answer every call. Your Bot can.

00:00:28.200 --> 00:00:29.800
botbound.me
